Reasonning: Observing a significant increase in the memory_stts-dirty, memory_stts.otal.dirty, and cpu_kernel_ticks metric shows that the application is generating a large number of dirty pages, leading to increased kernel activity and putting the system under pressure to manage a large number of dirty pages and I/O requests. Therefore, the root cause metric may be memory_dats-dirty and memory_stats.otal_dirty.
Final answer:The root cause service is memory_stats_pgpgout,memory_stats_inactive_file,memory_stats_total_pgpgout,cpu_core_3_norm_pct,cpu_core_3_pct.
